{"dialogue": {"lines": [{"en": "What happened to you?", "r": "Aapko kya hua?", "sp": "Doctor", "t": "आपको क्या हुआ?"}, {"en": "Doctor, fever for two days.", "r": "Doctor, do din se bukhaar hai.", "sp": "Patient", "t": "डॉक्टर, दो दिन से बुख़ार है।"}, {"en": "Any cough or cold?", "r": "Khaansi-zukaam hai?", "sp": "Doctor", "t": "खाँसी-ज़ुकाम है?"}, {"en": "Only a cough.", "r": "Sirf khaansi hai.", "sp": "Patient", "t": "सिर्फ़ ख़ाँसी है।"}, {"en": "Don't fear. Take this tablet.", "r": "Ghabraiye mat. Ye goli lijiye.", "sp": "Doctor", "t": "घबराइए मत। यह गोली लीजिए।"}, {"en": "Thanks doctor. Any diet restrictions?", "r": "Shukriya doctor. Koi parhez?", "sp": "Patient", "t": "शुक्रिया डॉक्टर। कोई परहेज़?"}], "title": "At the clinic"}, "lede": "Body, symptoms and the clinic — Hindi for staying well.", "phrases": [{"en": "I am not feeling well", "r": "Meri tabiyat theek nahin hai", "t": "मेरी तबीयत ठीक नहीं है"}, {"en": "I have a fever", "r": "Mujhe bukhaar hai", "t": "मुझे बुख़ार है"}, {"en": "My head aches", "r": "Mere sir mein dard hai", "t": "मेरे सिर में दर्द है"}, {"en": "Call a doctor", "r": "Doctor ko bulaiye", "t": "डॉक्टर को बुलाइए"}, {"en": "Take me to hospital", "r": "Mujhe aspatal le chaliye", "t": "मुझे अस्पताल ले चलिए"}, {"en": "Where is the pharmacy?", "r": "Davakhana kahaan hai?", "t": "दवाखाना कहाँ है?"}, {"en": "Take this medicine", "r": "Ye dava lijiye", "t": "यह दवा लीजिए"}, {"en": "Drink hot water", "r": "Garam paani pijiye", "t": "गरम पानी पीजिए"}, {"en": "Take rest", "r": "Aaraam kijiye", "t": "आराम कीजिए"}, {"en": "Get well soon", "r": "Jaldi theek ho jaiye", "t": "जल्दी ठीक हो जाइए"}, {"en": "Open your mouth", "r": "Munh kholiye", "t": "मुँह खोलिए"}, {"en": "Breathe deeply", "r": "Gehri saans lijiye", "t": "गहरी साँस लीजिए"}], "quiz": [{"a": "fever", "explain": "बुख़ार (bukhaar) = fever — मुझे बुख़ार है (I have a fever).", "id": "hi-25", "lesson": "hindi/advanced/health", "level": "beginner", "opts": ["fever", "cough", "cold", "pain"], "q": "बुख